SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This license covers ONLY the original PC port code written for this project —
principally the contents of src/platform/, server/, the PC build system
(Makefile_pc), and the port's own documentation.

It does NOT and CANNOT cover:

  * Pokemon FireRed / LeafGreen / Ruby / Sapphire / Gold / Silver / Crystal
    game code, data, graphics, music, text, or any other asset. Those are
    (c) Nintendo, Creatures Inc., and GAME FREAK inc. This project claims no
    rights to them and ships none of them.

  * The upstream decompilation sources this port builds on (pret/pokefirered,
    pret/pokeruby, pret/pokecrystal, and related projects), which are published
    without a license by their authors.

  * Third-party libraries bundled with or linked into the binary, which carry
    their own licenses. See THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt.

Running this software requires a ROM image that YOU legally own. The launcher
extracts assets from your own ROM at runtime into a local .pkmn archive. No
ROM data is included in this repository or in any release built from it.
